Palindrome Cut
==============

Write a function:

    def palindrome_cut(word: str) -> int

Return the minimum number of cuts needed to split word into pieces that are
all palindromes. A word that is already a palindrome needs 0 cuts.

Examples:
    palindrome_cut("aab") -> 1
    palindrome_cut("a") -> 0
    palindrome_cut("ab") -> 1
    palindrome_cut("abc") -> 2
    palindrome_cut("racecar") -> 0
